    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/8190d75d3b7978ad1b0fb42a41873811.poster.avif?t=1729971396\" width=616 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/8190d75d3b7978ad1b0fb42a41873811.webm?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/8190d75d3b7978ad1b0fb42a41873811.mp4?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Wasteland of Tomorrow!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world as you knew it? Long gone\u2014like a cassette tape that\u2019s been chewed up by a faulty player. In its place lies a vibrant, chaotic civilization where the remnants of life scrape by amid bizarre mutants, jittery robots, and terrible monsters that would give your worst nightmares a run for their money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/719403fc4bded68074f563900346331e.poster.avif?t=1729971396\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/719403fc4bded68074f563900346331e.webm?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/719403fc4bded68074f563900346331e.mp4?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this colorful post-apocalyptic playground, you\u2019ll need to assemble a ragtag team of fellow fortune seekers. Scavenge the wreckage of the old world for quirky artifacts, powerful weapons, and maybe even a dog treat or two\u2014because every hero deserves a snack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused on a team of characters, you build your team during each run (just like your deck), a chosen ally will bring their own pool of cards into the game as well as their own unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic movement and enemy intent system that requires players to juggle incoming damage and positioning their characters to avoid it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/14292573ead0e8bf56852d78798d18e0.poster.avif?t=1729971396\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/14292573ead0e8bf56852d78798d18e0.webm?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/14292573ead0e8bf56852d78798d18e0.mp4?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural mission system. Each 2-4 event adventure features unique combinations of enemies, modifiers, and rewards. Choose your challenge level and face the consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/b479978ed30f2bbfe0f43efdf73b1405.poster.avif?t=1729971396\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/b479978ed30f2bbfe0f43efdf73b1405.webm?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/b479978ed30f2bbfe0f43efdf73b1405.mp4?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful upgrades through gameplay alone: Expand your collection with booster packs, deck upgrades, artifacts, and consumables - no microtransactions, ever.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/1ab5c8d4581ac135d6002927ed62b323.poster.avif?t=1729971396\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/1ab5c8d4581ac135d6002927ed62b323.webm?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/1ab5c8d4581ac135d6002927ed62b323.mp4?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each mission through the forbidden zones, spend your hard-earned floppy disks (the currency used in the new world) to snag booster packs, heal or replace fallen teammates, or upgrade your deck with powerful sigils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/17a12658d0e6f03342f720c407863268.poster.avif?t=1729971396\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/17a12658d0e6f03342f720c407863268.webm?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/17a12658d0e6f03342f720c407863268.mp4?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your skills against the bizarre and dangerous creatures lurking in radioactive zones, where treasures await those brave enough to seek them. Claim your loot and build a deck of cards that\u2019ll take you further than anyone has dared to go. Unearth the mysteries of what happened to civilization and carve a path to your ultimate destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/ff7929be7d3891ee42c81f481f8d6457.poster.avif?t=1729971396\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/ff7929be7d3891ee42c81f481f8d6457.webm?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/ff7929be7d3891ee42c81f481f8d6457.mp4?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future may be bleak, but your adventure is just beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Wishlist the game now to get notified when the demo is released and join us on Discord to get early demo access and become a part of the game development journey!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/0df7fdfd167a530046ed8b660aa0b0e8.poster.avif?t=1729971396\" width=616 height=76 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/0df7fdfd167a530046ed8b660aa0b0e8.webm?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/0df7fdfd167a530046ed8b660aa0b0e8.mp4?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
