pps/2804770/extras/17a12658d0e6f03342f720c407863268.mp4?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your skills against the bizarre and dangerous creatures lurking in radioactive zones, where treasures await those brave enough to seek them. Claim your loot and build a deck of cards that\u2019ll take you further than anyone has dared to go. Unearth the mysteries of what happened to civilization and carve a path to your ultimate destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/ff7929be7d3891ee42c81f481f8d6457.poster.avif?t=1729971396\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/ff7929be7d3891ee42c81f481f8d6457.webm?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/ff7929be7d3891ee42c81f481f8d6457.mp4?t=1729971396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future may be bleak, but your adventure is just beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Wishlist the game now to get notified when the demo is released and join us on Discord to get early demo access and become a part of the game development journey!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/0df7fdfd167a530046ed8b660aa0b0e8.poster.avif?t=1729971396\" width=616 height=76 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2804770/extras/0df7fdfd167a530046ed8b660aa0b0e8.webm?t=1729971396\